                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*  PROGRAM    :  W1169100                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNKTION   :  MATCHAR 2 GENERATIONER AV W11690-FILEN FÖR ATT HITTA  *        
*                FÖRÄNDRADE ARTIKLAR (INDIEN).                         *        
*                SKAPAR FIL MED ICKE MATCHANDE POSTER SOM SKALL        *        
*                SKICKAS TILL VIPS.                                    *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FÖRFATTARE :  HÅKAN BOHLIN                                          *        
*                                                                      *        
*  DATUM      :  OKTOBER 2017                                          *        
*                                                                      *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*        FILE SECTION                  *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11691D1                                                                   
%W11616A  'NY-'                                                                 
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W11691D2                                                                   
%W11616A  'GL-'                                                                 
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*  UTFIL                               *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
FILE W11691D3 VB (340 0)                                                        
%W11620     'UT-'                                                               
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*     WORKING STORAGE                  *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
NEWPAGE                                                                         
PROGRAM-NAMN      W   6   A   VALUE 'W11691'                                    
DATUMKORT-ID      W   6   A   VALUE 'WDATUM'                                    
%WDATKORT 'DATKORT-'                                                            
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
WS-IDLANDX2       W    2  A   VALUE ' '                                         
*                                                                               
W001-MQ                     W  336  A                                           
W001-MQ-ATTR-NAME W001-MQ       16  A                                           
W001-MQ-IDLANDX2  W001-MQ +16    2  A                                           
W001-MQ-FILLER    W001-MQ +6   318  A VALUE ' '                                 
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*                                                                               
 DAGENS-DATUM             W  6 A                                                
 AA1     DAGENS-DATUM        2 A                                                
 MM1     DAGENS-DATUM  +2    2 A                                                
 DD1     DAGENS-DATUM  +4    2 A                                                
*                                                                               
WS-IDARTNR                    W  20 A                                           
 WS-IDARTNR-BLANK WS-IDARTNR     11 A                                           
 WS-IDARTNR-ALFA  WS-IDARTNR +11  9 A                                           
                                                                                
 SPAR-IDARTNR-NUM             W   9 N 0 VALUE  0                                
   SPAR-IDARTNR  SPAR-IDARTNR-NUM   9 A                                         
     SPAR-IDARTNR1 SPAR-IDARTNR       1 A                                       
     SPAR-IDARTNR2 SPAR-IDARTNR +1    1 A                                       
     SPAR-IDARTNR3 SPAR-IDARTNR +2    1 A                                       
     SPAR-IDARTNR4 SPAR-IDARTNR +3    1 A                                       
     SPAR-IDARTNR5 SPAR-IDARTNR +4    1 A                                       
     SPAR-IDARTNR6 SPAR-IDARTNR +5    1 A                                       
     SPAR-IDARTNR7 SPAR-IDARTNR +6    1 A                                       
     SPAR-IDARTNR8 SPAR-IDARTNR +7    1 A                                       
     SPAR-IDARTNR9 SPAR-IDARTNR +8    1 A                                       
                                                                                
*    -- CHECKED BY WY2000                                                       
                                                                                
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
*--------------------------------------*                                        
*      JOB INPUT                       *                                        
* -------------------------------------*                                        
                                                                                
JOB INPUT (W11691D1 KEY(NY-IDLANDX2 NY-IDARTNR)  +                              
           W11691D2 KEY(GL-IDLANDX2 GL-IDARTNR)) +                              
                             START A-INIT                                       
                                                                                
IF MATCHED                                                                      
   IF NY-RAD NE GL-RAD                                                          
      PERFORM B-BEARBETA-ARTIKELNR                                              
      PERFORM S01-SKRIV-UTPOST                                                  
   ELSE                                                                         
      IF NY-IDLEVNR-DUBLETT NE GL-IDLEVNR-DUBLETT           +                   
      OR NY-IDLEVNR-LOC-DUBLETT NE GL-IDLEVNR-LOC-DUBLETT   +                   
      OR NY-KDTIPPR  NE GL-KDTIPPR                          +                   
      OR NY-IDKAT(1) NE GL-IDKAT(1)                         +                   
      OR NY-IDKAT(2) NE GL-IDKAT(2)                         +                   
      OR NY-IDKAT(3) NE GL-IDKAT(3)                         +                   
      OR NY-BELEVART NE GL-BELEVART                         +                   
      OR NY-DADATUM  NE GL-DADATUM                          +                   
      OR NY-FLGEMFMC NE GL-FLGEMFMC                         +                   
      OR NY-TIURPROD NE GL-TIURPROD                         +                   
      OR NY-IDPROJUP NE GL-IDPROJUP                                             
         PERFORM B-BEARBETA-ARTIKELNR                                           
         PERFORM S01-SKRIV-UTPOST                                               
      END-IF                                                                    
   END-IF                                                                       
ELSE                                                                            
   IF W11691D1                                                                  
      PERFORM B-BEARBETA-ARTIKELNR                                              
      PERFORM S01-SKRIV-UTPOST                                                  
   END-IF                                                                       
END-IF                                                                          
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
A-INIT.   PROC                                                                  
   CALL DATKORT  USING (PROGRAM-NAMN +                                          
                        DATUMKORT-ID +                                          
                        DATKORT-DATUMKORT)                                      
   AA1 = DATKORT-D-AAR                                                          
   MM1 = DATKORT-D-MAANAD                                                       
   DD1 = DATKORT-D-DAG                                                          
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
B-BEARBETA-ARTIKELNR.   PROC                                                    
                                                                                
   SPAR-IDARTNR-NUM = NY-IDARTNR                                                
   IF SPAR-IDARTNR1 = '0'                                                       
     SPAR-IDARTNR1 = ' '                                                        
     IF SPAR-IDARTNR2 = '0'                                                     
       SPAR-IDARTNR2 = ' '                                                      
       IF SPAR-IDARTNR3 = '0'                                                   
         SPAR-IDARTNR3 = ' '                                                    
         IF SPAR-IDARTNR4 = '0'                                                 
           SPAR-IDARTNR4 = ' '                                                  
           IF SPAR-IDARTNR5 = '0'                                               
             SPAR-IDARTNR5 = ' '                                                
             IF SPAR-IDARTNR6 = '0'                                             
               SPAR-IDARTNR6 = ' '                                              
               IF SPAR-IDARTNR7 = '0'                                           
                 SPAR-IDARTNR7 = ' '                                            
                 IF SPAR-IDARTNR8 = '0'                                         
                   SPAR-IDARTNR8 = ' '                                          
                   IF SPAR-IDARTNR9 = '0'                                       
                     SPAR-IDARTNR9 = ' '                                        
                   END-IF                                                       
                 END-IF                                                         
               END-IF                                                           
             END-IF                                                             
           END-IF                                                               
         END-IF                                                                 
       END-IF                                                                   
     END-IF                                                                     
   END-IF                                                                       
   WS-IDARTNR-BLANK = ' '                                                       
   WS-IDARTNR-ALFA  = SPAR-IDARTNR                                              
                                                                                
END-PROC                                                                        
NEWPAGE                                                                         
S01-SKRIV-UTPOST.  PROC                                                         
                                                                                
   IF NY-IDLANDX2 NE WS-IDLANDX2                                                
                                                                                
      UT-W11620            = ' '                                                
      W001-MQ              = '¤MQMPROP Vidb_Source=Delta'.                      
      UT-W11620            = W001-MQ                                            
      PUT W11691D3                                                              
                                                                                
      UT-W11620            = ' '                                                
      W001-MQ              = ' '                                                
      W001-MQ              = '¤MQMPROP LoadType=Delta'.                         
      UT-W11620            = W001-MQ                                            
      PUT W11691D3                                                              
                                                                                
      UT-W11620            = ' '                                                
      W001-MQ              = ' '                                                
      W001-MQ-ATTR-NAME    = '¤MQMPROP Market='                                 
      W001-MQ-IDLANDX2     = NY-IDLANDX2                                        
      UT-W11620            = W001-MQ                                            
      PUT W11691D3                                                              
                                                                                
      WS-IDLANDX2          = NY-IDLANDX2                                        
   END-IF                                                                       
                                                                                
   UT-W11620               = ' '                                                
   UT-IDPTYP               = 'WA1'                                              
   UT-IDARTNR20            = WS-IDARTNR                                         
   UT-RAD                  = NY-RAD                                             
   UT-IDLEVNR-DUBLETT      = NY-IDLEVNR-DUBLETT                                 
   UT-IDLEVNR-LOC-DUBLETT  = NY-IDLEVNR-LOC-DUBLETT                             
   UT-DADATUM              = NY-DADATUM                                         
   UT-KDTIPPR              = NY-KDTIPPR                                         
   UT-IDKAT(1)             = NY-IDKAT(1)                                        
   UT-IDKAT(2)             = NY-IDKAT(2)                                        
   UT-IDKAT(3)             = NY-IDKAT(3)                                        
   UT-BELEVART             = NY-BELEVART                                        
   UT-FLGEMFMC             = NY-FLGEMFMC                                        
   UT-TIURPROD             = NY-TIURPROD                                        
   UT-IDPROJUP             = NY-IDPROJUP                                        
   UT-BEARTEXT             = NY-BEARTEXT                                        
   PUT W11691D3                                                                 
END-PROC                                                                        
*                                                                               
NEWPAGE                                                                         
